# Stage "publication": the numbers that go into the PR. Six rotations of the
# full matrix (every copy in every position twice; native in the two
# rotation-0 runs), then every extra at two runs per order (rotations 0 and 1,
# twice each: main before branch, and branch before main).
#
# Subset policy (as in stage main, budget about 5 h): the runtime extras run
# on the tier 1 subset T1, the JIT-tier extras on T1 too, the pollution
# profiles G1/G2/G10 at C and M, the loaders the headline subset H. No variant
# copies are prepared (--no-variants): main and the branch only.
#
# Expand with `node scripts/make-stage.mjs publication`, then start it with
#   printf 'sha=%s\nsteps=stages/publication.steps\n' <sha> > markers/READY-publication
# Directives (lines starting with @) are documented in scripts/make-stage.mjs.

